MAJOR CHANGES IN v3.1.1 (2026-03-18):
======================================
[FULL AUDIT — 7 bugs fixed, 2 features added]:
  * CRITICAL FIX: Self-heal queue detection counted ALL lines in input file
    instead of only unprocessed lines after last_position. This caused false
    "stagnant" triggers after ~6 commands, wiping the entire queue and dropping
    commands. Now reads only from current_position forward.
  * HIGH FIX: Duplicate hash detection used 5-minute window (not 2-sec as
    documented). Legitimate repeated commands (recompute, fitAll) were silently
    dropped. Reduced to 30-second window.
  * MEDIUM FIX: agent_id was missing from non-execute responses (ping, query,
    correct_command). Multi-AI result filtering via read_result() would timeout
    for these command types. All 7 response types now include agent_id.
  * MEDIUM FIX: importlib.import_module('sys') bypassed the security sandbox.
    AST validator now checks importlib.import_module() calls for blocked modules.
    Also added ast.ImportFrom check ('from os import path' was not caught).
  * LOW FIX: Processed command ID eviction used set→list which has no ordering.
    Now tracks insertion order via _processed_id_order list for true FIFO.
  * LOW FIX: Removed dead code is_duplicate_by_content() (defined, never called).
  * NEW: run_macro command type — AI agents can execute .FCMacro files safely
    without triggering exec()/open() sandbox blocks. Path-validated to only allow
    files under Macro_Directory or FreeCAD AppData.
  * NEW: Active document check on bridge connect — warns in Report View if no
    document is open, so AI agents know to create one first.

