MAJOR CHANGES IN v3.0.8 (2026-01-25):
======================================
[ERROR→FIX AUTOMATIC LEARNING]:
  * NEW: ErrorFixTracker class - tracks errors awaiting AI fixes
  * When AI sends a command that fails, the error is stored
  * When the NEXT command succeeds with similar structure, it's detected as a fix
  * The error→fix pair is automatically recorded in learning database
  * Uses similarity analysis (40-95% keyword overlap = likely correction)
  * Special detection for "has no attribute" errors (tracks bad attribute removal)
  * Generates human-readable solution descriptions automatically
  * Console feedback: "[LEARNED] Error→Fix pair recorded!"
  * 2-minute timeout for stale errors (prevents false matches)
  * Closes the learning loop: Error → AI Fix → Automatic Knowledge Update

